WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.943
The project asks students to build a small Spark SQL
pipeline First

00:00:06.114 --> 00:00:11.669
inspect the source schema and grain Second clean and
type the needed columns

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:18.966
Third summarize monthly product revenue or
readmission intervals Finally

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:24.746
validate output grain and totals In Spark validation
is still

00:00:24.772 --> 00:00:28.562
essential because distributed execution can make
mistakes expensive
